From: Miures Manager <contact@miures.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:34:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Data Analytics audit, phase 5: Intelligent Mode for
 analytics (the Ask tab)

A researcher asks in words; the server answers with a PROPOSAL of concrete,
individually reviewable items from a closed vocabulary (add_crosstab, add_test,
add_descriptive, remove_analysis, set_chart, build_report). Nothing runs until it
is applied, and applying re-validates every item against the live survey, saved
analyses and computed results. No operation carries a statistic.

- analyticsIntent (pure): findVariables (code or label words; option-flag
  columns excluded; ambiguity reported, never guessed), proposeFromText
  (cross-tabs per banner variable, tests, distributions, remove redundant /
  duplicate analyses, best chart per question with reasons and alternatives, a
  named chart, management summary / report / animated report), validateAskOp
  (duplicates via planCheck, analyses a report uses, charts the result cannot
  draw), parseAskOps / parseUndo (the browser's copy is rebuilt, not trusted),
  itemsFromModel (model operations coerced into the same vocabulary).
- planCheck: a significance test of a variable against itself is an error;
  crosstabCarriesChiSquare exported; "requested" provenance ignored by the
  analysis signature.
- Routes: intelligent/propose (read-only), apply, undo (analytics.edit). Apply is
  its own module (lib/analyticsAskApply.ts) so its real statements are tested
  against an in-memory database. Every applied change is audited with the
  request text. Reports are not created from Ask: they open in the report
  builder, pre-filled, for its review step.
- Studio: Ask tab (Proposed / Done / Blocked / Failed per item, per-item
  checkboxes, swap a chart for another that suits the result, undo the last
  batch, history on this device); the report builder accepts a pre-filled brief.
- docs/DATA-ANALYTICS-AUDIT-2026-10-12.md: root causes, what was delivered,
  verification, limits, configuration.

Tests: 19 reading-engine + 6 apply/undo + planCheck regression unit tests;
browser suite scripts/analytics-ask-test.mjs (17 checks); every source, apply
and UI mutation caught after strengthening the tests that first let mutants
survive. analytics 332, studio lib 304, pnpm -r test green, auth-guard audit
0 problems, public docs current.

